<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani interbank rates close higher.</title>
<headline>Pakistani interbank rates close higher.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's interbank money market rates closed higher on Saturday owing to a central bank open market operation, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates, which opened at 4.00 and 5.00 percent, closed at 13 percent amid the special open market operation by the State Bank of Pakistan, a dealer at Standard Chartered Bank in Karachi said.</p>
<p>-- Ibrahim Khan 9221-5685192</p>
